aultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=azurecomment;REDACTED\" />", "symbol": "ServiceConfiguration/ConfigurationSettings/DataConnectionString (AzureDeploy/src/AzureDeploy.Cloud/ServiceConfiguration.cscfg)"}
